.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Weierstrass proved in 1885 that every continuous function on a closed interval is a uniform limit of polynomials. Sergei Bernstein&#x27;s 1912 proof builds the polynomials explicitly: average f(k/n) with binomial weights. This script approximates a function with a kink, |x - 1/2|, and shows the uniform error shrinking, slowly, as the degree grows.">

